          "id": "python-algorithms-hash-maps-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"ChmK\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>exercise_02_description__python_algorithms_hash_maps%20%3D%20mo.md(%0A%20%20%20%20%22%22%22%0A%20%20%20%20%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0A%20%20%20%20Define%20%60first_unique(values)%60%20to%20return%20the%20first%20value%20occurring%20exactly%0A%20%20%20%20once%2C%20or%20%60None%60%20when%20every%20value%20is%20duplicated.%0A%20%20%20%20%22%22%22%0A)%0Aexercise_02_starter__python_algorithms_hash_maps%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20first_unique(values)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20counts%20%3D%20%7B%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20value%20in%20values%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20counts%5Bvalue%5D%20%3D%20counts.get(value%2C%200)%20%2B%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20value%20in%20values%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20counts%5Bvalue%5D%20%3D%3D%201%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20value%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20None'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%0A%20%20%20%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%0A%20%20%20%20min_height%3D220%2C%0A)%0Aexercise_02_submit__python_algorithms_hash_maps%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "id": "python-algorithms-hash-maps-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"KdvC\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='beb0b93d-130c-6762-5952-31f1b8677ee9' random-id='beb0b93d-130c-6762-5952-31f1b8677ee9'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _namespace: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _namespace = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    _function = _namespace[&#92;&quot;first_unique&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    assert _function([4, 5, 4, 6, 5]) == 6, &#92;&quot;check first unique order&#92;&quot;&#92;n    assert _function([1, 1, 2, 2]) is None, &#92;&quot;return None when no value is unique&#92;&quot;&#92;n    return _namespace&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, exercise_02_description__python_algorithms_hash_maps, exercise_02_starter__python_algorithms_hash_maps, _submission, exercise_02_submit__python_algorithms_hash_maps)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Define <code>first_unique(values)</code> to return the first value occurring exactly\nonce, or <code>None</code> when every value is duplicated.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='ChmK-0' random-id='2698b235-a8d8-79eb-7a3f-8d086f8ba9a9'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def first_unique(values):&#92;n    counts = {}&#92;n    for value in values:&#92;n        counts[value] = counts.get(value, 0) + 1&#92;n    for value in values:&#92;n        if counts[value] == 1:&#92;n            return value&#92;n    return None&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='220' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='ChmK-1' random-id='284fd104-459f-d325-7aaa-883379502baf'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_namespace%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_namespace%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20_function%20%3D%20_namespace%5B%22first_unique%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B4%2C%205%2C%204%2C%206%2C%205%5D)%20%3D%3D%206%2C%20%22check%20first%20unique%20order%22%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B1%2C%201%2C%202%2C%202%5D)%20is%20None%2C%20%22return%20None%20when%20no%20value%20is%20unique%22%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_namespace%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20exercise_02_description__python_algorithms_hash_maps%2C%20exercise_02_starter__python_algorithms_hash_maps%2C%20_submission%2C%20exercise_02_submit__python_algorithms_hash_maps)</marimo-cell-code>\n        </marimo-island>",
          "visible": true
        }
