          "id": "python-algorithms-searching-block-3",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n    data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n    data-cell-id=\"tasN\"\n    data-reactive=\"true\"\n>\n    <marimo-cell-output>\n    <span></span>\n    </marimo-cell-output>\n    <marimo-cell-code hidden>exercise_03_description__python_algorithms_searching%20%3D%20mo.md(%0A%20%20%20%20%22%22%22%0A%20%20%20%20%23%23%23%20Exercise%0A%0A%20%20%20%20Define%20%60binary_search(values%2C%20target)%60%20returning%20the%20target%20index%20or%0A%20%20%20%20%60-1%60.%20Assume%20%60values%60%20is%20sorted%20in%20ascending%20order.%0A%20%20%20%20%22%22%22%0A)%0Aexercise_03_starter__python_algorithms_searching%20%3D%20mo.ui.code_editor(%0A%20%20%20%20value%3D'def%20binary_search(values%2C%20target)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20left%2C%20right%20%3D%200%2C%20len(values)%20-%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20left%20%3C%3D%20right%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20middle%20%3D%20(left%20%2B%20right)%20%2F%2F%202%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20values%5Bmiddle%5D%20%3D%3D%20target%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20middle%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20values%5Bmiddle%5D%20%3C%20target%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20left%20%3D%20middle%20%2B%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20right%20%3D%20middle%20-%201%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20-1'%2C%0A%20%20%20%20language%3D%22python%22%2C%0A%20%20%20%20label%3D%22Your%20Python%20answer%22%2C%0A%20%20%20%20min_height%3D250%2C%0A)%0Aexercise_03_submit__python_algorithms_searching%20%3D%20mo.ui.run_button(label%3D%22Submit%20answer%22)</marimo-cell-code>\n</marimo-island>",
          "visible": false
        },
        {
          "id": "python-algorithms-searching-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"SXvM\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='c63035ea-1659-85d7-2df9-b8abc12b056b' random-id='c63035ea-1659-85d7-2df9-b8abc12b056b'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _namespace: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _namespace = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    _function = _namespace[&#92;&quot;binary_search&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    assert _function([1, 3, 5, 7, 9], 7) == 3, &#92;&quot;found index is incorrect&#92;&quot;&#92;n    assert _function([1, 3, 5, 7, 9], 4) == -1, &#92;&quot;missing values should return -1&#92;&quot;&#92;n    assert _function([], 4) == -1, &#92;&quot;handle an empty list&#92;&quot;&#92;n    return _namespace&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, exercise_03_description__python_algorithms_searching, exercise_03_starter__python_algorithms_searching, _submission, exercise_03_submit__python_algorithms_searching)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Define <code>binary_search(values, target)</code> returning the target index or\n<code>-1</code>. Assume <code>values</code> is sorted in ascending order.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='tasN-0' random-id='929942bf-6b36-5528-f0db-e2d18bbe1322'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def binary_search(values, target):&#92;n    left, right = 0, len(values) - 1&#92;n    while left &#92;u003c= right:&#92;n        middle = (left + right) // 2&#92;n        if values[middle] == target:&#92;n            return middle&#92;n        if values[middle] &#92;u003c target:&#92;n            left = middle + 1&#92;n        else:&#92;n            right = middle - 1&#92;n    return -1&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='250' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='tasN-1' random-id='f296a062-4d08-939f-7099-19f499cf5884'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_namespace%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_namespace%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20_function%20%3D%20_namespace%5B%22binary_search%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B1%2C%203%2C%205%2C%207%2C%209%5D%2C%207)%20%3D%3D%203%2C%20%22found%20index%20is%20incorrect%22%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B1%2C%203%2C%205%2C%207%2C%209%5D%2C%204)%20%3D%3D%20-1%2C%20%22missing%20values%20should%20return%20-1%22%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B%5D%2C%204)%20%3D%3D%20-1%2C%20%22handle%20an%20empty%20list%22%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_namespace%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20exercise_03_description__python_algorithms_searching%2C%20exercise_03_starter__python_algorithms_searching%2C%20_submission%2C%20exercise_03_submit__python_algorithms_searching)</marimo-cell-code>\n        </marimo-island>",
          "visible": true
        }
