          "id": "python-algorithms-sliding-window-block-4",
          "html": "<marimo-island\n            data-app-id=\"mlphd\"\n            data-cell-id=\"GbuD\"\n            data-reactive=\"true\"\n        >\n            <marimo-cell-output><marimo-ui-element data-mlphd-island-source-guard hidden object-id='52854617-09a3-5a2d-32e3-75ecf881c2c5' random-id='52854617-09a3-5a2d-32e3-75ecf881c2c5'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;@assertion(lambda _namespace: None)&#92;ndef _submission(source):&#92;n    _namespace = execute_submission(source)&#92;n    _function = _namespace[&#92;&quot;max_window_sum&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    assert _function([2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2], 3) == 9, &#92;&quot;window maximum is incorrect&#92;&quot;&#92;n    assert _function([1, 2], 0) is None, &#92;&quot;handle invalid sizes&#92;&quot;&#92;n    return _namespace&#92;n&#92;nproblem(mo, exercise_04_description__python_algorithms_sliding_window, exercise_04_starter__python_algorithms_sliding_window, _submission, exercise_04_submit__python_algorithms_sliding_window)&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n            <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"exercise\">Exercise</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Define <code>max_window_sum(values, size)</code> returning the largest sum of any\ncontiguous window of length <code>size</code>. Return <code>None</code> for invalid sizes.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='viyg-0' random-id='3f24b918-6864-2838-cb77-e0b2d128bccb'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def max_window_sum(values, size):&#92;n    if size &#92;u003c= 0 or size &#92;u003e len(values):&#92;n        return None&#92;n    current = sum(values[:size])&#92;n    best = current&#92;n    for index in range(size, len(values)):&#92;n        current += values[index] - values[index - size]&#92;n        best = max(best, current)&#92;n    return best&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eYour Python answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='240' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='viyg-1' random-id='7f208cc1-1d4b-50f3-0a35-c19eece0f590'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eSubmit answer&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan&#92;u003eEdit the answer, then click Submit answer.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>\n            </marimo-cell-output>\n            <marimo-cell-code hidden>%40assertion(lambda%20_namespace%3A%20None)%0Adef%20_submission(source)%3A%0A%20%20%20%20_namespace%20%3D%20execute_submission(source)%0A%20%20%20%20_function%20%3D%20_namespace%5B%22max_window_sum%22%5D%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B2%2C%201%2C%205%2C%201%2C%203%2C%202%5D%2C%203)%20%3D%3D%209%2C%20%22window%20maximum%20is%20incorrect%22%0A%20%20%20%20assert%20_function(%5B1%2C%202%5D%2C%200)%20is%20None%2C%20%22handle%20invalid%20sizes%22%0A%20%20%20%20return%20_namespace%0A%0Aproblem(mo%2C%20exercise_04_description__python_algorithms_sliding_window%2C%20exercise_04_starter__python_algorithms_sliding_window%2C%20_submission%2